{
  "name": "Stonic v1 · WhatsApp Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9e98cd09-3c67-4a51-b9bf-ea232a94ac59",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Stonic v1 (Stage 1)\nWhatsApp pe Roman Urdu assistant: chat, notes, reminders.\n\n1. Pehle **Test Chat** se test karo (WhatsApp ki zaroorat nahi).\n2. Data tables banao: `stonic_notes` (phone, note, created_at) aur `stonic_reminders` (phone, text, due_at, status). Har tool mein table select karo.\n3. Gemini credential lagao (free API key: aistudio.google.com).\n4. WhatsApp baad mein: Trigger + Reply node mein WhatsApp credentials aur Phone Number ID."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dbdbb7e6-19fd-469f-8979-0e4109577ffb",
